# Bypass Next.js /api rewrite when the proxy is slow or broken (CORS enabled on :9477).
# Worker control API (POST/PATCH — Start agents, settings, etc.)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_LI_WORKER_URL=http://127.0.0.1:9477
# Optional: override read API (default: same-origin Next /api → db-api)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_LI_READ_API_URL=

# Server-side rewrite target (next.config.ts); usually leave unset.
# LI_AGENT_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:9477
